<%- include('../partials/head', { title }) %>
<%- include('../partials/nav') %>

<main class="flex-1 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: <%= new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10) %> &middot; Placeholder template &mdash; have a lawyer review before you go live, and check what data protection law applies to your users (e.g. GDPR/DPDP).</p>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">1. What we collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Account data:</strong> name, email address, and a securely hashed password (we never store your plain-text password).</li>
        <li><strong>Order data:</strong> the Instagram link/username you submit, service ordered, quantity and order status.</li>
        <li><strong>Wallet data:</strong> your balance and transaction history, and fund-request details you submit (amount, payment reference).</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address and basic request logs, used for security and abuse prevention.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">2. How we use it</h2>
      <p>To create and secure your account, process and fulfil your orders, maintain your wallet balance,
        respond to support requests, and detect fraud or abuse. We do not sell your personal data.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">3. Sharing with our upstream provider</h2>
      <p>To fulfil an order we send the minimum data needed &mdash; the service ID, the link/username you
        submitted, and the quantity &mdash; to our upstream fulfillment provider's API. We do not send
        your name, email or password to the provider.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use a single essential session cookie to keep you logged in. We don't use third-party
        advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">5. Data retention</h2>
      <p>We keep account and order data for as long as your account is active, and as needed to resolve
        disputes, enforce our terms, and meet legal/accounting obligations.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can request a copy of your data, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete your account by
        contacting <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-700 underline">support</a>. Some data may be
        retained where required by law.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-2">7. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Reach us via the <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-700 underline">contact page</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
